>Please help a newbie!  What do you engrave?

Anything.  A good way to identify wands is to observe their effects when
you engrave with them: a wand of fire will burn something into the
floor, a wand of slow monster will slow down the bugs on the ground, etc.

>Can I ask for a translation?  GoP are Gauntlets of Power, whats GDSM and SoC?

SoC = scrolls of charging, the first thing you always wish for when you
find a wand of wishing (so you can recharge it, of course).

GDSM = gray dragon scale mail, which provides magic resistance and a good
       AC for little weight
(At low levels, magic resistance is probably most useful for making
teleport and polymorph traps harmless.  A SoR (shield of reflection)
(or AoR, if you're using a two-handed weapon) is probably more useful.)

BTW, GoP aren't all that great for non-Valkyries: once you have an 18
constitution and an 18/thirty-something strength, you have the maximum
carrying capacity, and 18/** gives you the maximum damage bonus.
I prefer a blessed BoH (bag of holding) - you'll find one eventually,
but it's nice to have more than one, anyway.

